":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-06-11T14:26:58Z","updated_at":"2026-06-15T13:56:44Z","closed_at":"2026-06-15T13:56:44Z","assignee":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.3-rc1 and later, 4.7-dev4 and later, (with Jolt physics)\n- Not reproducible in: 4.6.2 and earlier, 4.7-dev3 and earlier\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.3.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7652) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-4790 CPU @ 3.60GHz (8 threads) - 31.93 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nChanging `PhysicsBody.process_mode` to `PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED` on `Area3D.body_entered` signal will permanently disable collision detection between this two instances even if `process_mode` is later (or right away) changed back to `PROCESS_MODE_INHERIT` or any other option.\n\nExample:\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tbody_entered.connect(_on_body_entered)\n\t\nfunc _on_body_entered(body: Node3D) -> void:\n\tbody.process_mode = Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED\n\n\t# Changing back process_mode later, right away, after await, or in any other function call\n\t# will result two bodies never detect collision again\n\n\tbody.process_mode = Node.PROCESS_MODE_INHERIT\n```\n\nI'm asuming bug is introduced with issue [GH-118285](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118285) since it's meged with both v4.6.3-rc1 and v4.7-dev4.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Download and run demo project\n- Use keyboard arrow keys do move blue cube to touch red ball\n- Ball should disappear on collision and appear on the other side of the screen\n- In versions 4.6.3-rc1 and later, trying to move cube to touch sphere again will not  emit body_entered signal againg, while in earlier versions (or switching 3D physics to GodotPhysics3D) work as intendent.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-collision-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28842632/test-collision-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120193/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120193/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}